  "idea": "Client revision tracker that enforces scope boundaries automatically",
  "text": "Protect your team's bandwidth and your agency's profit margins with automated scope tracking. Scope creep sneaks in through dozens of tiny client favors that derail your weekly production calendar. When your task manager cannot flag out-of-scope tickets, senior producers end up working unpaid nights and weekends. Set up Zapier to validate new Asana tasks against your contract, automatically flagging extra requests as paid add-ons. You protect operational margins without tension.",
